          "Key": "V010_Decal_002_name",
          "SourceString": "猎犬奔袭-涂装",
          "LocalizedString": "Hound Blitz - Livery"
        },
        "Description": {
          "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_VehicleData.ST_VehicleData",
          "Key": "V010_Decal_002_desc",
          "SourceString": "「我之前还一直在担心，这玩意会不会把我的脸印上去……因为之前在大街上看到过别人的款式。幸好没有，这下我自己也能用上啦！这配色真帅啊！」",
          "LocalizedString": "\"I was actually kinda worried this thing would print my face on it… I’ve seen other people’s versions out on the street before. Thank god it doesn’t! Now I can finally use it myself! This colorway looks awesome!\""
        },
        "bDefault": false,
